      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 1: \n\nClick **the Backpack icon** in the left-side menu. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1c61e53656f55ec446bce2b9fb8c315d-backpack step 1v2.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-fe585fd5-6be2-4d90-84a9-e04d332f1182"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 2: \n\nClick **“Save Sketch to Backpack”** in the bottom-left hand menu.\n\nName your sketch and click **\"Save to Backpack\"**.\n\nYou will see a confirmation that your sketch was saved.",
